function roleImageStudioOutfitModal(id,draft,title){const owner=roleImageStudioOwner(id);if(owner&&owner._userImageStudio)title=draft.edit?'编辑我的衣物':'添加我的衣物';_roleImageOutfitDraft=draft;const fixed=roleImageTimeRangeValid(draft),start=fixed?draft.timeStart:'07:00',end=fixed?draft.timeEnd:'09:00';openModal(`<h3>${esc(title||'添加角色衣物')}</h3><div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:4px 0 6px">${roleImageStudioThumb(draft.image,'衣物参考')}</div>${draft.edit?`<button class="btn g" style="display:block;width:auto;min-width:132px;margin:0 auto 8px;padding:8px 12px" onclick="roleImageStudioOutfitReplaceImage('${id}')">仅替换图片</button>`:''}<div class="field" style="margin-bottom:9px"><label>衣物名字</label><input id="rio_name" value="${esc(draft.name||'')}" placeholder="例如：深蓝丝质睡衣、白色医生工服"></div><div class="field" style="margin-bottom:9px"><label>适用场景</label><select id="rio_occasion" style="width:100%;border:1px solid #38383a;border-radius:8px;padding:8px;background:#2c2c2e;color:#eee">${ROLE_IMAGE_OCCASIONS.map(x=>`<option value="${x[0]}" ${x[0]===(draft.occasion||'daily')?'selected':''}>${x[1]}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field role-image-time-field" style="margin-bottom:9px;padding:10px"><label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px"><input id="rio_time_fixed" type="checkbox" ${fixed?'checked':''}>启用固定穿着时间</label><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:7px;margin-top:7px"><label style="min-width:0;font-size:12px;color:#888">开始<input id="rio_time_start" type="time" value="${esc(start)}" oninput="roleImageStudioOutfitTimeTouch()" onchange="roleImageStudioOutfitTimeTouch()" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;min-width:0;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:3px;padding:6px 4px;font-size:14px"></label><label style="min-width:0;font-size:12px;color:#888">结束<input id="rio_time_end" type="time" value="${esc(end)}" oninput="roleImageStudioOutfitTimeTouch()" onchange="roleImageStudioOutfitTimeTouch()" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;min-width:0;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:3px;padding:6px 4px;font-size:14px"></label></div><small style="display:block;color:#888;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.4">结束时间早于开始时间时会自动按跨午夜处理；改动时间会自动启用，取消勾选后保存即可恢复随机。</small><button class="btn p" style="width:100%;margin-top:7px;padding:8px 10px" onclick="roleImageStudioOutfitTimeSave('${id}')">单独保存这个时间段</button></div><div class="field" style="margin-bottom:9px"><label>补充说明</label><textarea id="rio_note" rows="2" placeholder="颜色、版型、材质，以及什么时候适合穿">${esc(draft.note||'')}</textarea></div><div class="btns"><button class="btn g" onclick="_roleImageOutfitDraft=null;closeModal()">取消</button><button class="btn p" onclick="roleImageStudioOutfitSave('${id}')">保存到衣柜</button></div>`);}
